  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan turns into clouds and mist to avoid Ni Jian’s fist, Qi Zai flicks his finger and activates this mortal killer move. A pellet of qi the size of a thumb flies so quickly that Fang Yuan cannot dodge, and his real body is exposed. Lion fur armor covers Fang Yuan; the pellet does not harm him and only forces him to appear. When Ni Jian, with rank six battle strength, is toyed with, Qi Zai uses the move again and sends out countless pellets of qi. Fang Yuan dodges a few, then cannot dodge more, and blocks them head on with lion fur armor.",
